        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "24, 110",
        "index": "0x3ab",
        "attributes": "186e000019000000ff00000015000400",
        "text": [
            "Tu connais ce Shad? Le type ",
            "qui est {1a06ff000001}au sous-sol{1a06ff000000}."
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "24, 112",
        "index": "0x3ad",
        "attributes": "1870000019000000ff00000015000400",
        "text": [
            "{1a05000000}, Shad t'attend!",
            "Il est {1a06ff000001}au sous-sol{1a06ff000000}."
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "25, 110",
        "index": "0x421",
        "attributes": "196e000005000000ff00000001000400",
        "text": [
            "Ah! oui, euh... je m'appelle {1a06ff000002}Shad{1a06ff000000}",
            "et je fais des recherches sur la",
            "légende du peuple des {1a06ff000001}Célestiens{1a06ff000000}..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "25, 137",
        "index": "0x43c",
        "attributes": "1989000005000000ff00000007030400",
        "text": [
            "Les seules indices qui pourraient ",
            "nous aider se trouvent peut-être ",
            "dans la {1a06ff000001}mémoire{1a06ff000000} d'{1a06ff000001}Ilia{1a06ff000000}."
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "25, 140",
        "index": "0x43f",
        "attributes": "198c000005000000ff00000006030400",
        "text": [
            "Aah... {1a07000007000a}Si seulement Ilia pouvait ",
            "recouvrer la mémoire..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "25, 163",
        "index": "0x456",
        "attributes": "19a3000005000000ff00000002000400",
        "text": [
            "Au fait, on m'a raconté qu'Ilia était",
            "l'une de tes amies?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "ID": "25, 206",
        "index": "0x481",
        "attributes": "19ce00003b000000ff00000009000400",
        "text": [
            "Les {1a06ff000001}Galerries Balder{1a06ff000000} qui sont ici",
            "orrganisent une {1a06ff000001}collecte de fonds{1a06ff000000}",
